{
 "cues": [
  {
   "text": "New drug to regenerate lost teeth.",
   "start": 0.45,
   "end": 2.418,
   "section": "hero"
  },
  {
   "text": "Multiplying teeth.",
   "start": 3.212,
   "end": 4.324,
   "section": "hero"
  },
  {
   "text": "Regrowing teeth.",
   "start": 5.122,
   "end": 6.164,
   "section": "hero"
  },
  {
   "text": "Headlines like these travel fast.",
   "start": 6.962,
   "end": 8.756,
   "section": "hero"
  },
  {
   "text": "The follow-up rarely does.",
   "start": 9.555,
   "end": 10.886,
   "section": "hero"
  },
  {
   "text": "So, years later:",
   "start": 11.685,
   "end": 12.854,
   "section": "hero"
  },
  {
   "text": "what came of it?",
   "start": 13.027,
   "end": 13.78,
   "section": "hero"
  },
  {
   "text": "\u201cWhat came of it?\u201d is a public record of what",
   "start": 14.43,
   "end": 16.27,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "followed reported medical breakthroughs.",
   "start": 16.281,
   "end": 18.226,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each claim gets one page:",
   "start": 19.021,
   "end": 20.514,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "one treatment, for one condition.",
   "start": 20.722,
   "end": 22.505,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "At the top is where it stands now.",
   "start": 23.303,
   "end": 25.086,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "This one, first reported in 2021,",
   "start": 25.884,
   "end": 28.326,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "has reached a Phase 1 trial:",
   "start": 28.558,
   "end": 30.039,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "an early trial in people,",
   "start": 30.178,
   "end": 31.451,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "checking safety.",
   "start": 31.625,
   "end": 32.4,
   "section": "claim"
  },
  {
   "text": "Underneath are the dated records that say so.",
   "start": 33.05,
   "end": 35.365,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "A trial registered in October 2024.",
   "start": 36.16,
   "end": 38.637,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "The same trial shown as complete",
   "start": 39.436,
   "end": 41.033,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "in October 2025.",
   "start": 41.044,
   "end": 42.653,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every record links to the",
   "start": 43.452,
   "end": 44.517,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "registry that holds it,",
   "start": 44.528,
   "end": 45.547,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "so you can check it yourself.",
   "start": 45.732,
   "end": 47.005,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "And what was promised sits",
   "start": 47.804,
   "end": 48.903,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "beside what was recorded.",
   "start": 48.915,
   "end": 50.281,
   "section": "records"
  },
  {
   "text": "The status is set by fixed rules,",
   "start": 50.931,
   "end": 52.806,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "from public registry records.",
   "start": 52.991,
   "end": 54.623,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "No editor decides it,",
   "start": 55.418,
   "end": 56.61,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "and no AI model does either.",
   "start": 56.795,
   "end": 58.438,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "When nothing new has been recorded for years,",
   "start": 59.237,
   "end": 61.297,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "the page says exactly that:",
   "start": 61.471,
   "end": 62.744,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "no signal for ten years.",
   "start": 62.929,
   "end": 64.434,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "That describes the records.",
   "start": 65.232,
   "end": 66.656,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "It is not a verdict on the treatment.",
   "start": 67.455,
   "end": 69.191,
   "section": "rules"
  },
  {
   "text": "Seen a headline shared again?",
   "start": 69.841,
   "end": 71.23,
   "section": "lookup"
  },
  {
   "text": "Paste the article's link into",
   "start": 72.025,
   "end": 73.321,
   "section": "lookup"
  },
  {
   "text": "the box on the home page.",
   "start": 73.332,
   "end": 74.698,
   "section": "lookup"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the claim is tracked,",
   "start": 75.497,
   "end": 76.538,
   "section": "lookup"
  },
  {
   "text": "the answer comes back at once.",
   "start": 76.631,
   "end": 78.159,
   "section": "lookup"
  },
  {
   "text": "The link is compared inside your browser,",
   "start": 78.957,
   "end": 80.902,
   "section": "lookup"
  },
  {
   "text": "and sent nowhere.",
   "start": 81.075,
   "end": 81.851,
   "section": "lookup"
  },
  {
   "text": "There is also a browser extension,",
   "start": 82.501,
   "end": 84.191,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "for Chrome and Safari.",
   "start": 84.33,
   "end": 85.475,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "Open it on an article,",
   "start": 86.27,
   "end": 87.335,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "and it shows the tracked claim's",
   "start": 87.578,
   "end": 88.817,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "status right there.",
   "start": 88.828,
   "end": 89.754,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the article is not tracked,",
   "start": 90.553,
   "end": 91.919,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "it can search the trial registries live.",
   "start": 92.138,
   "end": 94.175,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "Those results are marked automatic",
   "start": 94.974,
   "end": 96.629,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "and unreviewed,",
   "start": 96.641,
   "end": 97.196,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "and every match shows its confidence score.",
   "start": 97.405,
   "end": 99.419,
   "section": "extension"
  },
  {
   "text": "No medical advice.",
   "start": 100.069,
   "end": 101.261,
   "section": "outro"
  },
  {
   "text": "No verdicts.",
   "start": 102.056,
   "end": 103.039,
   "section": "outro"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only what the records show,",
   "start": 103.838,
   "end": 105.134,
   "section": "outro"
  },
  {
   "text": "and when.",
   "start": 105.389,
   "end": 105.887,
   "section": "outro"
  },
  {
   "text": "What came of it?",
   "start": 106.685,
   "end": 107.484,
   "section": "outro"
  },
  {
   "text": "Find out, at whatcameofit.com.",
   "start": 108.282,
   "end": 110.366,
   "section": "outro"
  }
 ],
